  "content_text_body": "New research reveals that how we collaborate as a team contributes more to resilience than external stressors. On resilient teams, individuals feel responsible for energizing each other. This is in stark contrast to teams who are challenged by frustrating ways of working and fractured relationships. [Adopting three simple practices](<HBR_Practices_That_Set_Resilient_Teams_Apart>) will help teams become more resilient - and re-energized.",
